   "rot": -155,
   "text": "THE DROWNED MARCHES\n\nThe causeway walked pilgrims out of the kingdom, beacon to beacon, until the water took the road's memory.\n\nKindle them as the day walked: dawnward first, then the midway fire, then duskward \u2014 toward the sun that never finished setting."
